<title>USA: Typhoon Fern threatens  shipping west of Guam - WSC.</title>
<headline>Typhoon Fern threatens  shipping west of Guam - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Fern is becoming a high risk to shipping west of Guam as top winds reach 100 mph, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp (WSC) said on Friday.</p>
<p>It was expected to track towards the northern Mariana islands, which could suffer flooding and possibly property damage.</p>
